message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "Extremes on Rewind: ensemble generation and analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Research code for generating and analyzing 1,000-member weather ensembles
  conditioned on a final (extreme) state using cBottle-video. A modified copy
  of NVIDIA Earth2Studio 0.17.0a0.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
